1
00:00:04,204 --> 00:00:06,104
(Leonard:)Okay, we're headed out--
See you later.

2
00:00:06,107 --> 00:00:07,307
(Sheldon:)Before you leave,

3
00:00:07,308 --> 00:00:09,778
(Sheldon:)could you test these
noise-cancelling headphones?

4
00:00:09,777 --> 00:00:10,777
(Leonard:)Yeah, sure.

5
00:00:10,778 --> 00:00:11,848
(Leonard:)Okay.

6
00:00:13,781 --> 00:00:14,781
(Sheldon:)Go ahead.

7
00:00:14,782 --> 00:00:17,552
(Leonard:)Hello, can you
hear me?

8
00:00:20,621 --> 00:00:22,151
(Leonard:)Sheldon, I haven't changed
the filter

9
00:00:22,156 --> 00:00:24,086
(Leonard:)in the water pitcher
in two years.

10
00:00:27,128 --> 00:00:31,028
(Penny:)Uh, Bernadette's nickname for
you is the virgin piña colada.

11
00:00:34,135 --> 00:00:38,205
(Leonard:)Your George Lucas autograph
is really a "me" autograph.

12
00:00:40,307 --> 00:00:43,307
Yeah, well, once I was too lazy
to walk across the hall,

13
00:00:43,310 --> 00:00:45,040
(Penny:)so I used your toothbrush.

14
00:00:47,048 --> 00:00:49,178
(Leonard:)Ooh, and one time
when you were asleep,

15
00:00:49,183 --> 00:00:51,013
(Leonard:)Amy totally
took off her...

16
00:00:51,018 --> 00:00:53,088
(Leonard:)And that's why
you're the best roommate ever.

17
00:00:54,321 --> 00:00:56,721
(Sheldon:)Aw...

18
00:00:56,724 --> 00:00:58,154
(Sheldon:)Now I'm sad I didn't hear it.

19
00:00:58,159 --> 00:01:00,829
(Penny:)So what do you need
the headphones for?

20
00:01:00,828 --> 00:01:02,228
(Sheldon:)Well, I've been
struggling for months

